		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4184&amp;p=31850#p31850"><![CDATA[
That values are based on what kind of radio you have. If your radio maximum power is 5W then the only lowest number on each steps is for you. If your radio maximum power is 10W, then the middle number is, and lastly, if your radio maximum power is 50W(40W), Then the biggest number is.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5068">KA1CM</a> — Thu Jun 27, 2024 8:00 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
